{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-12-02 17:33:00', 'title': 'OMNICOM GROUP INC. DECLARES DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK, DEC. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF OMNICOM GROUP INC. (NYSE:\xa0OMC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF\xa070 CENTS\xa0PER OUTSTANDING SHARE OF THE CORPORATION'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0JANUARY 11, 2022\xa0TO OMNICOM GROUP COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0DECEMBER 21, 2021."}{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-12-02 10:20:00', 'title': "OMNICOM'S CREDERA LAUNCHES ATLANTA OFFICE TO SERVE SOUTHEAST REGION", 'text': 'ATLANTA, DEC. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CREDERA, A GLOBAL BOUTIQUE CONSULTING FIRM FOCUSED ON STRATEGY, INNOVATION, DATA, AND TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF A NEW OFFICE IN ATLANTA TO SUPPORT ITS GROWING ROSTER OF CLIENTS IN THE SOUTHEASTERN UNITED STATES. CREDERA IS PART OF THE OMNICOM PRECISION MARKETING GROUP (OPMG), THE DIGITAL AND CUSTOMER RELATIONSHIP MANAGEMENT SPECIALIST PRACTICE AREA WITHIN OMNICOM GROUP INC. (NYSE:\xa0OMC).'}